Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Determination of the Neutrino Time of Flight:\[LineSeparator]Fermilab to Ash \
River\
\>", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.999347617647799*^9, 
  3.999347618966331*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5af8e11a-62bf-4184-a8d8-\
4c6d0b07646f"],

Cell["\<\
NOvA beam trigger delay (i.e. t0 delay) based on GPS antenna positions, \
detector offsets, and Earth models (converted to in 64 MHz NOvA clock ticks\
\>", "Subtitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9993476283040533`*^9, 
  3.999347664199382*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"838a7e12-6353-437e-9725-\
cde802b46cdc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Sources.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (1) A. Norman, \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Determination of the Neutrino Time \
of Flight, Fermilab to Ash River\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], NOvA-DocDB- draft, \
19 Aug 2014 (",
 StyleBox["nova-fnal-ashriver-timing-calc.pdf", "InlineCode"],
 "), cited below as ",
 StyleBox["the 2014 note",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". (2) ",
 StyleBox["FNAL_to_AshRiver_Distance.nb", "InlineCode"],
 " (Mathematica, Mar 2013 \[Dash] Mar 2017), cited as ",
 StyleBox["the 2013 notebook",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". The 2014 note is the primary reference. It supplies the antenna fixes, \
the antenna \[RightArrow] detector offsets and the trigger-window definition. \
The Main Injector timing shift comes from the 2013 notebook, since the note \
does not cover it."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.999362207238472*^9, 
  3.9993622077828207`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1be739d3-a79d-4541-b0b5-\
356a1e8e8fba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every equation in the 2014 note is written out here, with its equation \
number, and implemented. The note's quoted results and the 2013 notebook \
outputs are then reproduced, and the result is recomputed with the offsets \
the note actually specifies. That changes the answer, see \[Section]9. \
\[Section]11 lists the note's typographical and numerical errata. Evaluate \
the whole notebook with ",
 StyleBox["Evaluation \[RightArrow] Evaluate Notebook",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". All inputs and switches are in \[Section]2 and \[Section]4."
}], "Text"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Purpose: the beam trigger window", "Section"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The NOvA DAQ issues a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]beam\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
trigger from the NuMI spill time t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["", "0"]]],
 ", delayed by the neutrino flight time t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["", 
   RowBox[{"0", "delay"}]]]],
 " from the Near Detector (ND) cavern to the front face of the Far Detector \
(FD). The NuMI spill is nominally 10 \[Micro]s long. The DAQ discretizes data \
into 50 \[Micro]s microslices, and the event builder can only extract whole \
microslices. The optimal trigger therefore places the 10 \[Micro]s spill \
inside a 50 \[Micro]s window with at least 20 \[Micro]s of sideband on each \
side. That window is the half-open interval (2014 note, eq. 1):"
}], "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TagBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]T", "trig"], "\[Colon]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["t", "0"], "+", 
      SubscriptBox["t", 
       RowBox[{"0", "delay"}]], "-", 
      RowBox[{"20", " ", "\[Micro]s"}]}], "\[LessEqual]", "t", "<", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["t", "0"], "+", 
      SubscriptBox["t", 
       RowBox[{"0", "delay"}]], "+", 
      RowBox[{"30", " ", "\[Micro]s"}]}]}]}],
   HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula"],

Cell["\<\
The upper edge is open. Microslices are closed intervals (eq. 2):\
\>", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TagBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Mu]Slice", "\[Colon]", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["t", "n"], "\[LessEqual]", "t", "\[LessEqual]", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["t", "n"], "+", 
      RowBox[{"50", " ", "\[Micro]s"}]}]}]}],
   HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A 50 \[Micro]s trigger window therefore always overlaps exactly two \
microslices, so every recorded beam event is 100 \[Micro]s wide wherever t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["", "0"]]],
 " falls relative to the microslice boundaries. t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["", 
   RowBox[{"0", "delay"}]]]],
 " must be set a priori from the flight-time calculation below, and the \
window is evaluated in \[Section]8."
}], "Text"]
}, Open  ]],

