Cell["\<\
Raising the FNAL end lengthens the chord and lowering the FD end shortens it, \
because the chord dips below the local horizontal at both ends (\[Section]9). \
The net change is about +10.1 m, +34 ns, +2.2 ticks.\
\>", "Text"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

