Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
9. Main Injector timing shift and combined beam offset (2013 notebook, Part 4)\
\>", "Section"],

Cell["\<\
Not in the 2014 note. After the 2012 shutdown, beam relative to the Main \
Injector Beam Sync event MIBS $74 moved by 141 MI revolutions of h = 588 RF \
buckets at 53.1034 MHz (flat-top RF). This is a timing-reference correction \
and is added to the flight time when the trigger is referenced to MIBS $74.\
\>", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TagBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["T", "rev"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    FractionBox[
     SubscriptBox["h", "MI"], 
     SubscriptBox["f", "RF"]]}],
   HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  TagBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]t", "MI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["N", "turns"], " ", 
     SubscriptBox["T", "rev"]}]}],
   HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula"],

