Cell["\<\
Because the chord dips 3.6\[Degree] below the horizontal at both ends, \
\[PartialD]L/\[PartialD]h \[TildeTilde] +0.063 at each end. Raising either \
end lengthens the flight path.\
\>", "Text"],

