Cell["\<\
The eq. 7 row is expected to fail (erratum). The last row recomputes the 2013 \
chord with east-positive longitudes, as the 2013 notebook entered them, and \
compares it with the west-negative result.\
\>", "Text"]
}, Open  ]],

